**.subckt tb_vco
VDD vdd 0 3.3
VC vctrl 0 1.5
VB0 b0 0 0
VB1 b1 0 0
XVCO vctrl b0 b1 loip loin loqp loqn vr vdd 0 vco_ring4
CLloip loip 0 60f
CLloin loin 0 60f
CLloqp loqp 0 60f
CLloqn loqn 0 60f
